  "visual_review": "Five actual final-run screenshots reviewed: Quantum visible model-front meridional extent, 26 March 5 m ADCP comparison, 25 March shared remote approximation, mobile visible model-front extent and mobile remote approximation. Component/case headings are separated; the headline explicitly says visible model-front estimate. Date, east-side clipping, model inference, instrument/depth distinctions and non-simultaneity limits are visible without clipping. All 86 regression/current-batch screenshot captures executed; five selected PNGs retained with the complete hash/byte inventory. Other captures were not manually reviewed and their PNG bytes are not retained in this compact artifact. All browser assertions passed.",
